         for its CQRS scan, which only resolves if that DLL is in this project's output. Same
         reasoning as the Identity.Application / Hr.Application references above. -->
    <ProjectReference Include="..\..\..\src\Modules\Notifications\Notifications.Application\Notifications.Application.csproj" />
